<title>HUNGARY: PRIMAGAZ RALLIES IN LACK OF SUPPLY - TRADER.</title>
<headline>PRIMAGAZ RALLIES IN LACK OF SUPPLY - TRADER.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liquefied gas retalier Primagaz Rt shares rose more than 15 percent on Thursday in what dealers attributed to lack of supply.</p>
<p>&quot;There simply are not enough shares around at previous lower prices,&quot; said Peter Nagy of Postabank Securities.</p>
<p>He added that some hedging activity could also have contributed to Primagaz's rally.</p>
<p>At 1139 GMT, Primagaz shares stood at 11,000 forints, up 1,450.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
